// AWS IAM Account Access Removal  [tier: hunt]  ATT&CK: T1531
// Detects removal of IAM access (DeleteUser/DeleteLoginProfile/DeleteAccessKey), which attackers use to lock out legitimate users/responders.…
// False positives: Offboarding and key cleanup. Correlate with HR/offboarding processes.
// Source: rules/impact/iam-delete-user-lockout.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
from * metadata _id, _index, _version | where (eventName in ("DeleteUser", "DeleteLoginProfile", "DeleteAccessKey")) and eventSource=="iam.amazonaws.com"
